[b]Speculative Markets 1.1.4-beta.11[/b]

Brings the beta up to stable 1.1.4 and adds these fixes.

[list]
[*]Banking chart thresholds use your market depth at each level of leverage.
[*]Simultaneous Blue Chip promotions and distress events target their respective companies. Promotion estimates account for Home of Great Companies.
[*]Bear Raids expire on their own timers. The raid card shows active raiders, fractional damage and the annual cap.
[*]Rival action previews account for Exchange size, specialities and defenses. A decisive-win preview identifies any existing capital lure.
[*]Each contest shows when it settles. Competition names the next rival due. Shore Up distinguishes protection duration from its two-year cooldown.
[*]Capital lures conserve cash when the losing investment pool is nearly empty.
[/list]
